  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to front line health actors in Gaza and the West Bank.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The British Red Cross (BRC) is an established FCDO partner through which funding is channelled to Red Crescent National Societies in high-risk contexts. Under this programme, funding will be provided to BRC, which will in turn support the Palestine Red Crescent Society (PRCS) as the principal frontline health actor in Gaza and the West Bank. PRCS operates hospitals and primary health clinics and delivers ambulance services across Palestine.</narrative>
  </description>
